title: seventeenth_hour_warning
---
Milo: *(ears swiveling, eyes wide)*
Milo: Hour seventeen approaches. The Tartarian day-out-of-time.
Milo: Old things wake at this hour. Stay close to the dome.
===

title: seventeenth_hour_eruption
---
Milo: *(reverent)*
Milo: There. The cathedral light. The whole dome is *singing* now.
Milo: Look up. The seam-pulse — that's what the Tartarians called *seam-song*. The architecture itself is alive.
===

title: seventeenth_hour_skeleton_speaks
---
Milo: *(quiet, awed)*
Milo: The skeleton... it's humming.
Milo: That's a prophecy fragment. Korath, maybe. Listen carefully.
===

title: seventeenth_hour_prophecy_1
---
Lirael: *(whispered, far away)*
Lirael: "The first three buildings sing as one. Listen for the harmonic across the valley.
Lirael: When you hear it, you will know which way to walk."
===

title: seventeenth_hour_giant_key
---
Milo: A skeleton key. Made by the giants.
Milo: That's number one. There are seven more across the other Moons. Collect them all and a great door opens.
===

title: seventeenth_hour_aftermath
---
Anastasia: *(softly, from the dome)*
Anastasia: You felt that, didn't you. The whole grid lit, just for a moment.
Anastasia: That is what we used to do every seventeenth hour, before the Mud Flood.
Anastasia: The world remembers, traveler. Even after centuries.
===

title: ley_line_map_appears
---
Milo: *(spinning excitedly)*
Milo: A ley line map appeared on your wrist — see it?
Milo: Three lines, three colors. They radiate from this valley to others.
Milo: Follow the gold line east. That's where we're going next.
===
